  // ⭐ THE BASE SHOE TEMPLATE — every future sneaker/boot starts from this.
  // A SINGLE shoe (the engine draws it once per foot on the per-frame feetX
  // anchor). Spec that MUST be preserved for a new shoe to line up + cover:
  //   • viewBox 100×50 (10×5 units), drawn per foot, bottom hung at FEET_BOTTOM.
